@startuml usecase_system_overview
left to right direction
title Design Pattern Playground - System use case overview

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam actorStyle awesome

actor "Visiteur" as Visitor
actor "Utilisateur connecte" as Member

rectangle "Design Pattern Playground\n(Frontend React + Backend Spring Boot)" {
  usecase "Explorer le catalogue\nde patterns" as UC_CATALOG
  usecase "Consulter une fiche\npattern" as UC_PATTERN_PAGE
  usecase "Configurer une demo" as UC_CONFIGURE
  usecase "Executer une simulation" as UC_EXECUTE
  usecase "Visualiser le pattern\n(scene SVG + UML)" as UC_VISUALIZE
  usecase "Lire le contenu\npedagogique" as UC_LEARN
  usecase "Creer un compte" as UC_REGISTER
  usecase "Se connecter" as UC_LOGIN
  usecase "Maintenir une session\nsecurisee" as UC_SESSION
  usecase "Passer un quiz" as UC_QUIZ
  usecase "Obtenir un score\npondere" as UC_SCORE
  usecase "Debloquer un badge" as UC_BADGE
  usecase "Suivre sa progression" as UC_PROGRESS
  usecase "Consulter ses statistiques\npar pattern" as UC_STATS
}

database "PostgreSQL" as DB

Visitor --> UC_CATALOG
Visitor --> UC_PATTERN_PAGE
Visitor --> UC_CONFIGURE
Visitor --> UC_EXECUTE
Visitor --> UC_VISUALIZE
Visitor --> UC_LEARN
Visitor --> UC_REGISTER
Visitor --> UC_LOGIN

Member --|> Visitor
Member --> UC_QUIZ
Member --> UC_PROGRESS

UC_PATTERN_PAGE .> UC_CONFIGURE : <<include>>
UC_PATTERN_PAGE .> UC_VISUALIZE : <<include>>
UC_PATTERN_PAGE .> UC_LEARN : <<include>>
UC_EXECUTE .> UC_PATTERN_PAGE : <<extend>>

UC_LOGIN .> UC_SESSION : <<include>>
UC_REGISTER .> UC_SESSION : <<include>>
UC_QUIZ .> UC_SCORE : <<include>>
UC_QUIZ .> UC_BADGE : <<extend>>
UC_PROGRESS .> UC_STATS : <<include>>

UC_SESSION --> DB : users + refresh tokens
UC_PROGRESS --> DB : quiz progress
UC_BADGE --> DB : persisted status

note right of UC_EXECUTE
Le backend peut executer la demo,
mais le frontend peut aussi degrader
sur un fallback local si l API est indisponible.
end note

note right of UC_SCORE
Le score depend :
- des bonnes reponses
- de la difficulte des questions
- de la complexite du pattern
end note

note bottom of UC_BADGE
Badge valide si 75% minimum
de bonnes reponses.
end note

@enduml
